## Priority 4: Accessibility Compliance (WCAG 2.2 AA)

- [ ] **4.1 Keyboard Navigation**
    - [ ] Test Tab/Shift+Tab through all interactive elements
    - [ ] Verify focus indicators visible on all elements
    - [ ] Test Enter/Space on buttons
    - [ ] Test Escape on modals (if applicable)
    - [ ] Ensure no keyboard traps

- [ ] **4.2 Screen Reader Testing**
    - [ ] Test with NVDA (Windows) or VoiceOver (Mac)
    - [ ] Verify ARIA landmarks announced
    - [ ] Verify all form labels associated with inputs
    - [ ] Verify button text announced correctly
    - [ ] Test icon `aria-hidden="true"` on decorative SVGs

- [ ] **4.3 Color Contrast**
    - [ ] Test all text on primary-600 background (WebAIM checker)
    - [ ] Test all button text contrast
    - [ ] Test form input text contrast
    - [ ] Test focus indicator contrast (≥3:1)

- [ ] **4.4 Touch Targets**
    - [ ] Verify all buttons ≥44×44px (`min-h-[44px]`)
    - [ ] Test on mobile device (real or emulator)
    - [ ] Verify 8px spacing between touch targets

## Priority 5: Responsive Design

- [ ] **5.1 Mobile (320px - 767px)**
    - [ ] Test hero heading scales down (`text-4xl`)
    - [ ] Test cards stack vertically (`grid-cols-1`)
    - [ ] Test navigation collapses to hamburger
    - [ ] Test footer stacks vertically

- [ ] **5.2 Tablet (768px - 1023px)**
    - [ ] Test cards display 2 columns (`md:grid-cols-2`)
    - [ ] Test navigation expands
    - [ ] Test hero heading scales up (`md:text-5xl`)

- [ ] **5.3 Desktop (1024px+)**
    - [ ] Test cards display 3 columns (`lg:grid-cols-3`)
    - [ ] Test container max-width (`max-w-7xl`)
    - [ ] Test all hover states

